### 2. Preparing for the Preliminary Hearing
Preliminary hearings usually focus on procedural matters, setting timelines, or deciding temporary orders, rather than arguing the whole case.
*   **What is the primary goal or expected outcome of this specific preliminary hearing?**
*   **Will I be required to speak or testify at this hearing, or will you be doing all the talking?**
