*   **How does the contract dispute with my former employer intersect with the fact that my ex-spouse is the opposing party?** 
*   **How do these proceedings in Maricopa County directly impact my standing in immigration court?**
*   **Are we handling all of these issues in one consolidated case, or will there be separate proceedings?**

